，属于执行节奏慢了一拍。  \n我现在继续无缝往下跑（先填第1步执照/法人，再依次到第5步提交），除非遇到验证码或硬阻塞，不会再中途打断你。","textSignature":"msg_08f156a86b8a806b0169d632652f988196a7765f8305aa4db9"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":30591,"output":213,"cacheRead":15616,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46420,"cost":{"input":0.05353425,"output":0.002982,"cacheRead":0.0027328,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.05924905}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775645276776}}
