{"type":"message","id":"e9e93894","parentId":"a00f2db1","timestamp":"2026-04-08T11:08:27.055Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_xsa4HYEjjPhPw2RzaLitLN0Q|fc_08f156a86b8a806b0169d6372903688196afa5d97cca20f3d2","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def step2_tap_region_field 4233\ndef step2_tap_region_field() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"点击商户所在地区字段，打开滚轮 picker\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    b = find_bounds(xml, '请选择地区')\n    if not b:\n        # 尝试找已有值的字段\n        b = find_bounds(xml, '商户所在地区')\n    if not b:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"region_field_not_found\", instruction=\"未找到'请选择地区'字段\")\n\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after=1)\n    screenshot()\n\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"wheel_select_region\",\n        instruction=\"\"\"picker 已打开，三列联动（省/市/区）。\n\n【滚轮通用规则】\n- swipe duration 必须 ≥ 400ms，否则惯性甩动停在不可预测位置\n- 每次 swipe 后等 0.8s 再截图，等惯性完全停止\n- 每行约 70px；N 行距离 = N×70px\n- 最小有效距离 80px，低于此系统忽略\n- 方向：目标在下方 → swipe y 从大到小（手指上划）；目标在上方 → swipe y 从小到大（手指下划）\n\n【四川省快速定位（列表默认从安徽省开始）】\n四川省在省份列表约第 2\n\n def step3_confirm_region 5623\ndef step3_confirm_region(province: str, city: str, district: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"LLM 完成滚轮选择后：找确定按钮 → 点击 → 验证字段值\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    b = find_picker_confirm(xml)\n    if not b:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"confirm_button_not_found\", instruction=\"picker 确定按钮未找到，picker 可能已关闭\")\n\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after=1)\n\n    # 验证字段值\n    xml2 = dump_ui()\n    region_b = find_bounds(xml2, '商户所在地区')\n    actual = find_text_value(xml2, '商户所在地区') or \"\"\n\n    expected_parts = [province, city, district]\n    if all(p in actual for p in expected_parts):\n        return result_ok(\"step4_tap_category_field\", region_display=actual)\n\n    # 字段值不对\n    screenshot()\n    return result_need_llm(\n  \n\n def step4_tap_category_field 6509\ndef step4_tap_category_field() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"点击商户类别字段，打开滚轮 picker\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    b = find_bounds(xml, '请选择商户类别')\n    if not b:\n        b = find_bounds(xml, '商户类别')\n    if not b:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"category_field_not_found\")\n\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after=1)\n    screenshot()\n\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"wheel_select_category\",\n        instruction=\"\"\"picker 已打开，单列，选项极短（企业 / 个体工商户 / 小微）。\n\n【滚轮规则】swipe duration ≥ 400ms，每次 swipe 后等 0.8s，每行约 70px\ncol1 center_x=540\n\n列表顺序通常为：企业（默认中心）→ 个体工商户 → 小微\n- 目标\"个体工商户\"→ 上滑 1 行：swipe 540 1680 540 1610 450\n- 目标\"小微\"→ 上滑 2 行：swipe 540 1680 540 1540 450\n- 目标\"企业\"已在中心 → 无需滑动\n\n选好后【不要点确定】，调用：\npython3 runner.py step5_\n\n def step5_confirm_category 7308\ndef step5_confirm_category(merchant_category: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"LLM 完成滚轮选择后：找确定按钮 → 点击 → 验证字段值 → 确认区块展开\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    b = find_picker_confirm(xml)\n    if not b:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"confirm_button_not_found\", instruction=\"picker 确定按钮未找到\")\n\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after=1)\n\n    xml2 = dump_ui()\n    actual = find_text_value(xml2, '商户类别') or \"\"\n\n    if merchant_category not in actual:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_need_llm(\n            \"category_value_mismatch\",\n            actual=actual,\n            expected=merchant_category,\n            instruction=\"类别字段值不符，请重新点击字段，重新选择，再调用 step5_confirm_category\"\n        )\n\n    # 确认营业执照信息区块已展开\n    i\n\n def run_all 17932\ndef run_all(**kwargs) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"自动执行到第一个 NEED_LLM 为止\"\"\"\n    r = step1_check_page()\n    if r[\"status\"] != \"ok\":\n        return r\n\n    r = step2_tap_region_field()\n    # step2 必定返回 NEED_LLM（需要 LLM 做滚轮选择）\n    return r\n\n\n# ─── Step 注册表 ──────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nSTEPS = {\n    \"step1_check_page\":       (step1_check_page,       []),\n    \"step2_tap_region_field\": (step2_tap_region_field, []),\n    \"step3_confirm_region\":   (step3_confirm_region,   [\"province\", \"city\", \"district\"]),\n    \"step4_tap_category_field\": (step4_tap_category_field, []),\n    \"step5_confirm_category\": (step5_confirm_category, [\"merchant_category\"]),\n    \"step6_upload_license\":   (step6_upload_license"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":37,"aggregated":"def step2_tap_region_field 4233\ndef step2_tap_region_field() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"点击商户所在地区字段，打开滚轮 picker\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    b = find_bounds(xml, '请选择地区')\n    if not b:\n        # 尝试找已有值的字段\n        b = find_bounds(xml, '商户所在地区')\n    if not b:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"region_field_not_found\", instruction=\"未找到'请选择地区'字段\")\n\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after=1)\n    screenshot()\n\n    return result_need_llm(\n        \"wheel_select_region\",\n        instruction=\"\"\"picker 已打开，三列联动（省/市/区）。\n\n【滚轮通用规则】\n- swipe duration 必须 ≥ 400ms，否则惯性甩动停在不可预测位置\n- 每次 swipe 后等 0.8s 再截图，等惯性完全停止\n- 每行约 70px；N 行距离 = N×70px\n- 最小有效距离 80px，低于此系统忽略\n- 方向：目标在下方 → swipe y 从大到小（手指上划）；目标在上方 → swipe y 从小到大（手指下划）\n\n【四川省快速定位（列表默认从安徽省开始）】\n四川省在省份列表约第 2\n\n def step3_confirm_region 5623\ndef step3_confirm_region(province: str, city: str, district: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"LLM 完成滚轮选择后：找确定按钮 → 点击 → 验证字段值\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    b = find_picker_confirm(xml)\n    if not b:\n        screenshot()\n        return result_fail(\"confirm_button_not_found\", instruction=\"picker 确定按钮未找到，picker 可能已关闭\")\n\n    tap(b[0], b[1], sleep_after=1)\n\n    # 验证字段值\n    xml2 = dump_ui()\n    region_b = find_bounds(xml2, '商户所在地区')\n    actual = find_text_value(xml2, '商户所在地区') or \"\"\n\n    expected_parts = [province, city, district]\n    if all(p in actual for p in expected_parts):\n        return result_ok(\"step4_tap_category_field\", region_display=actual)\n\n    # 字段值不对\n    screenshot()\n    return result_need_llm(\n  \n\n def step4_tap_category_field 6509\ndef step4_tap_category_field() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"点击商户类别字段，打开滚轮 picker\"\"\"\n    xml = dump_ui()\n    b = find_bounds(xml, '请选择商户类别')\n    if not b:\n        b = find_bounds(x